 -ogsbrc="" data-ogsbbc="" data-ogsblc="">writing</span> to each bring our
  own perspective.&#160\;</p><p>  Whether you're a writer or simply curiou
 s to try something new\, you'll find inspiration here and a welcoming com
 munity to share the journey.</p><h3>  What to Bring</h3><ul><li>your favo
 rite pencil (no pens).  </li><li>a notebook or paper. Clipboards are avai
