SUMMARY:Bloomington Stationery Club Meet-up
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the final Bloomington Stationery Club meet-up of 
 the year on December 9th at the Cook Center for Public Arts and Humanitie
 s! From 5-7 pm come hang out and junk journal\, write letters\, set up yo
 ur planner\, etc. with us! Get ready for the holidays with us and bring f
 un stationery items to share and swap.  Light refreshments will be provid
 ed. Come bond over stationery with us before break!&#160\;
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Join us for the final Bloomington Stati
 onery Club meet-up of the year on December 9th at the Cook Center for Pub
 lic Arts and Humanities! From 5-7 pm come hang out and junk journal\, wri
 te letters\, set up your planner\, etc. with us! Get ready for the holida
 ys with us and bring fun stationery items to share and swap.</p><p>  Ligh
 t refreshments will be provided. Come bond over stationery with us before
  break!&#160\;</p>
