DESCRIPTION:Spark your creative writing through close looking and convers
 ation.&#160\;Whether you're a writer or simply curious to try something n
 ew\, you'll find inspiration here and a welcoming community to share the 
 journey.  What to Bringyour favorite pencil (no pens).  a notebook or pap
 er. Clipboards are available to borrow.  a phone or camera to take a pict
 ure of the art for later reference.  Know Before You GoArrive early\, che
 ck in\, and get ready for an on-time start.Readwhere to find us\, where t
 o park\, accessibility\, and museum guidelines.About Your Facilitator  De
 daimia Whitney earned an MFA in fiction from Indiana University under the
  direction of Scott Russell Sanders. She taught creative writing at Frank
 lin College for many years. She has served the museum as a docent since 2
 019. Her favorite works of art are those that are both visually stimulati
 ng and thought-provoking.
