 a full-time internship and two nights per week in the classroom at our IU
  headquarters at our new IU Capital Campus. This experience cultivates pr
 actical professional skills while helping you build the network critical 
 to a successful career in Washington\, D.C.✔ Live and learn in the hear
 t of U.S. government✔ Build real-world experience and a DC network✔ E
 xplore agencies\, embassies\, and think tanks✔ Have a semester you'll n
